{"nodeId":"kp:21104","contents":[],"requirements":{"knowledgeRequirement":{"value":"教材用角终边上异于原点的点P(x,y)定义余切比为x/y，要求y不等于零；终边在x轴上时余切无意义。","originalWording":"如图6-1-7，在任意角$\\alpha$的终边上任取异于原点的一点$P$，设其坐标为$(x,y)$，并令$|OP|=r$，必有$r=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}>0$．这样，就可以分别定义角$\\alpha$的正弦、余弦、正切、余切为\n\\sin\\alpha=\\frac yr,\\qquad\\cos\\alpha=\\frac xr,\n\\tan\\alpha=\\frac yx\\ (x\\ne0),\\qquad\\cot\\alpha=\\frac xy\\ (y\\ne0).\n应当注意的是：当$\\alpha=k\\pi+\\frac\\pi2\\ (k\\in\\mathbf Z)$，即角$\\alpha$的终边位于$y$轴上时，$\\tan\\alpha=\\frac yx$无意义；而当$\\alpha=k\\pi\\ (k\\in\\mathbf Z)$，即角$\\alpha$的终边位于$x$轴上时，$\\cot\\alpha=\\frac xy$无意义．","scope":"材料支持范围：直接支持余切比与无意义条件；以角的弧度数作变量时须排除kπ，不把这段改称教材独立余切函数定义。","status":"material_supported","sourceId":"TB-B2","sourceEdition":"既有已接收教材/教案材料；不是新增2025独立细点条文","evidence":[{"id":"ev:book-2:L089:arbitrary-trig-definition-b0","sourceId":"TB-B2","sourceSha256":"492092a8c87c004406f396db214fc2355757d1ec5407919ca372b5e5e04df485","locator":{"headingPath":["L089","教材任意角三角比坐标定义及切余切条件"],"part":"pdf","paragraphIndex":null,"paragraphIndexConvention":null,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":15,"pdfPage":15,"printedPage":8,"equationObjectId":null},"quote":"如图6-1-7，在任意角$\\alpha$的终边上任取异于原点的一点$P$，设其坐标为$(x,y)$，并令$|OP|=r$，必有$r=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}>0$．这样，就可以分别定义角$\\alpha$的正弦、余弦、正切、余切为","wordingChecked":true,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"rawMetadataRetainedInOriginalJson":true,"resource":{"url":"r80/assets/0e8142a3da0fdd2249953122.png","bytes":136067,"sha256":"0e8142a3da0fdd2249953122657f93e09da36dd2ebc74ecb113b4bdc0b0f5550","sourceId":"TB-B2","kind":"same_original_textbook_pdf_page","localOrigin":"/Users/yichen.zhang/vibe coding/codex/projects/数学教育平台/knowledge-network/review/textbook-content/page-evidence/b2-ch6/pdf-015.png","expectedHashMatched":null,"requestedPath":"increments/l089-v1/evidence/TB-B2/page-15.png"},"sourceTitle":"必修第二册","sourceStatus":"original_source_identity_preserved"},{"id":"ev:book-2:L089:arbitrary-trig-definition-b1","sourceId":"TB